Sound effects and music levels for the page's settings panel. On the web
both managers always exist and level 0 is mute (-10000), so a level can be
raised from 0 without a reload. wyd_audio_set_levels keeps the levels for
NewApp::Initialize before boot (they win over Config.bin) and applies them to
the live managers after boot with the original curves. Windows build unchanged
apart from a null check after a failed CSoundManager::Initialize.

